{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>iPhone Duo，蘋果首款可摺疊iPhone，今日開始接受預訂。然而，預訂開放僅數分鐘，預計出貨日期已開始延後至明年。</p>\n<p>首批iPhone Duo預訂訂單預計將於10月23日送達，但僅限及時下單的幸運消費者。</p>\n<p>截至美國東部時間上午8時30分，所有iPhone Duo型號均已缺貨至明年。所有顏色及儲存容量組合的預計出貨日期均顯示為1月25日。</p>\n<p>你今朝成功搶到iPhone Duo預訂了嗎？如果有，你選了哪一款？預計幾時送到？歡迎喺留言區分享。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-16-at-8.32.36-AM.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:39:54.423218+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":1,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:32:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:40.966709+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:40.966709+00:00","content_hash":"b52e2033445fcdb7a5887a966f219019252313e0cd2e2a0ef15bc2ec55c2fd21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}